"<p>SaaSBase includes an automated in-place upgrade mechanism under <strong>Settings -> Instance -> Upgrade to vX</strong>.</p>\n<h2>How In-Place Upgrades Work</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>The panel takes an automatic self-backup before starting.</li>\n<li>An isolated <strong>Updater Container</strong> is launched with access to the Docker socket.</li>\n<li>The updater stops the old panel, runs database migrations, and brings up the new version.</li>\n<li>It waits up to <code>UPGRADE_HEALTH_TIMEOUT_SECONDS</code> for the <code>/api/health</code> endpoint to answer.</li>\n<li>If the new version fails health checks, it rolls back to the previous image automatically.</li>\n</ol>"